From 6141aa5319e40df3b75541423ddc203324c17394 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 22:54:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Backup RTE experience page

New page documenting Backup RTE experience on an 8-team ART, built to
match the existing topic-page conventions (agile-flexing.html et al):
same shared CSS block, header/heroshot/body/final/footer structure,
full OG + Twitter meta, and the infographic-as-hero pattern.

- backup-rte.html          the page
- hero-backup-rte.jpg      one-pager infographic used as the hero
- og-backup-rte.jpg        1200x630 social card
- backup-rte-onepager.png  full-resolution download offered on the page
- resources.html           adds an "Experience" card linking the page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XDAqHp4G9Px44Bha5tegMi
